{{- /* HTML part of the [[.Human]] email of the [[.Mailer]] mailer: html/template, every value is escaped for its context. */ -}}
<p>Hello,</p>
<p>This is the "[[.Human]]" email of the [[.MailerHuman]] mailer. Edit it in
<code>app/mailers/templates/[[.Mailer]]/[[.Name]].html.gohtml</code>.</p>
[[- if .Fields]]
<ul>
[[- range .Fields]]
	<li>[[.Label]]: {{.[[.Title]]}}</li>
[[- end]]
</ul>
[[- end]]
